'''Saudi Arabia''' is the 14th stage in [[Empire of Cats]]. In [[The Battle Cats POP!]], clearing this stage unlocks the [[Cat Capsule|Capsule Machine]], [[Enemy Guide|Enemy Encyclopedia]], and [[THE DYNAMITES (Gacha Event)|THE DYNAMITES]] as an available banner to roll.

