==Battleground==
*Infinite [[Doge]]s spawn, delay 21.33~37.33 seconds<sup>640f~1,120f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Snache]]s spawn after 20 seconds<sup>600f</sup>, delay 40~80 seconds<sup>1,200f~2,400f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Those Guys]] spawn after 40 seconds<sup>1,200f</sup>, delay 40~80 seconds<sup>1,200f~2,400f</sup>.
*1 [[Hippoe]] spawns.
*When the base reaches 99% HP:
**6 [[Those Guys]] spawn, delay 2~4 seconds<sup>60f~120f</sup>.
*When the base reaches 50% HP:
**1 [[Hippoe]] spawns.

==Strategy==
Start the battle by upgrading the [[Worker Cat]]. When Hippoe gets close, spam meatshields, [[Gross Cat (Normal Cat)|Gross Cat]] and [[Bird Cat (Normal Cat)|Bird Cat]]; keep spamming until you win.

