==Trivia==
*In the [[Nyanko Daisensou|Japanese version]], this stage takes place in '''Shimane Prefecture'''.
*Shimane Prefecture's base is [[wikipedia:Izumo-taisha|Izumo-taisha]], the oldest Shinto shrine in Japan.

